      "content": "it's just hard to see a \"story\" when everything is a dead end. i feel like i'm just stuck in this loop of shame. the thought of starting over or trying to \"pivot\" feels so exhausting and pointless. like, why even try to fix something that's fundamentally broken? i just feel so heavy. like there's no way out of this feeling.",
